   807	<code>tmux -S &lt;runtime&gt;/tmux/ax.sock</code>. The
   808	<code>&lt;runtime&gt;/tmux</code> parent MUST be AX-created, owned by the current
   809	user, mode 0700, and verified component-by-component without following a
   810	symlink. Before bind, connect, rename, or unlink, AX MUST reject a socket path,
   811	parent, or ancestor whose resolved identity changed or whose file kind,
   812	ownership, or permissions are unsafe. The socket is runtime IPC, never durable
