- P1 CLOSED (read-only atomicity): added `TestAttachReadOnlyOverlapAdmissionAtomicAcrossLifecycleInstances`. It pauses the first receipt after staging, races a second read-only client through an independent Lifecycle/store, and asserts one receipt/vector. `N-M2-attach-admission-lock-input-only` was run alone; it KILLED and the raw log shows the second receipt and read-only vector were returned.
